      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is an album cover rug?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "An album cover rug is a rug printed with an album-cover-style design. Chillgen makes them in four rectangular sizes: 24\"x36\", 36\"x60\", 48\"x72\" and 60\"x96\". Prices start at $31.85 for the 24\"x36\" size, and the Music Lover Rugs collection has 15 designs."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How big will the cover be on album rugs?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "An album cover is square, so it can't be wider than the rug's short side. The largest possible cover is 24\" on a 24\"x36\" rug, 36\" on a 36\"x60\", 48\" on a 48\"x72\" and 60\" on a 60\"x96\". These are upper limits, and a design with a border shows a smaller cover."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I personalize an album cover rug?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. All 15 designs in Chillgen's Music Lover Rugs collection are described as personalized gifts for music lovers. Each design's product page sets out what you can change."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Are music rugs, sometimes searched as \"rug music\", non-slip?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "14 of the 15 designs in Chillgen's Music Lover Rugs collection list a non-slip plastic-point backing. Check the page for the design you choose to confirm it has this line."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is there a matching tapestry for an album rug?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Some designs offer a matching tapestry in 60\"x40\", 60\"x50\", 80\"x60\" or 90\"x70\", with prices listed from $48.85. The tapestry sizes are closer to square than the rug sizes, so a square cover leaves less spare space around it."
      }
    }
  ]
